# impeccable-ignore-start
# Impeccable design tool. Kept in Git: config.json, design.json, surfaces/*.md and critique/*.md.
# Everything else in .impeccable/ stays on this computer: screenshots, caches, live/ and config.local.json.
.impeccable/*
!.impeccable/config.json
!.impeccable/design.json
!.impeccable/surfaces/
.impeccable/surfaces/*
!.impeccable/surfaces/*.md
!.impeccable/critique/
.impeccable/critique/*
!.impeccable/critique/*.md
# impeccable-ignore-end

